\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The boundary map: where reference matching ranks models.} Cross-family Spearman correlation between mean \textsc  {TFA}{} and accuracy (17 models; bootstrap CIs), and the Qwen size-ladder correlation as the within-family column, per benchmark. Ranking degrades from olympiad to saturated benchmarks, with code sitting mid-scale, and within-family ladders survive everywhere the pooled comparison does not, because family style cancels inside a family and survives across families.}}{5}{table.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
